cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof and verification package, please cite this archived release."
title: "K-2 Sparse High-Power Divisor Sums for All Bounded-Omega Integers"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
authors:
  - name: "mxym"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
url: "https://github.com/mxym/math/tree/release/factor-kminus2-sums-bounded-omega-v1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained proof and deterministic verification package showing that,
  for every fixed K at least 3, K-2 predetermined exact high-power divisor
  sums suffice to factor every integer with at most K distinct prime divisors,
  allowing arbitrary multiplicities, in polynomial-in-log(n) bit complexity
  relative to the stated divisor-sum oracle.
keywords:
  - integer factorization
  - divisor sums
  - bounded omega
  - cyclic resultants
  - effective elimination
